{
 "_comment": "【検証用】予算を分け合う人たちの調達（追記R547・R562・R563・R564・R565・R566）。調達は案件ごとの業務フローで、起案者の分割チャネルに入る。予算管理担当（予算のレコードの担当者）が承認し、承認の OK を予算の上での確定とみなす。予算合計は予算管理担当が作るレコード（トーク的業務）で、確定合計と、それに含めた案件の ID だけを持つ。起案者は、予算管理担当が作った最新の予算合計を existing: _latest で読み、自分の金額 ≦ 限度額 − 確定合計 を掛ける。起案の後と承認の後に予算管理担当が新しい合計を作り、その中で確定合計が限度額に収まるかを確かめる（追記R567）。利用者が1人の予算も同じ節で扱い、違いは予算のレコードの利用者だけである（追記R568・R802。予算管理担当は1人で、すべての予算を登録し、予算合計を作り、承認する）。",
 "@id": "urn:bud:ontology",
 "@type": "Ontology",
 "defines": [
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Template",
   "@type": "Class",
   "_comment": "complete は OK ボタンの無いタスクの完成（追記R552）。完成した日時 end はそれが真になったときに書かれる（追記R564・R742）",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Template",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#isComplete",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#complete",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "テンプレート",
    "en": "Template"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Atom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Atom",
    "urn:bud:Template"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "アトムノード",
    "en": "Atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Task",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Task",
    "urn:bud:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "タスクノード",
    "en": "Task"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Constraint",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Constraint",
    "urn:bud:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "制約ノード",
    "en": "Constraint"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:OtherAtom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#OtherAtom",
    "urn:bud:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "その他のアトムノード",
    "en": "Other atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Cancelable",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Task",
    "#Cancelable"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "取消可能タスク",
    "en": "Cancelable"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "#Person",
   "_comment": "Profile.xlsx で定義されたクラス Person（追記R531・R532）",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [],
   "label": {
    "ja": "人",
    "en": "Person"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "#agent",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "担当者",
    "en": "Agent"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Geq",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Constraint"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "≧",
    "en": "AtLeast"
   },
   "#builtInFunction": "greaterEqual",
   "isConstraint": true
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Equals",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Constraint"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "＝",
    "en": "Equals"
   },
   "#builtInFunction": "equal",
   "isConstraint": true
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Then",
   "@type": "Class",
   "label": {
    "ja": "Then",
    "en": "Then"
   },
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Then"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg1",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第1引数",
    "en": "Arg 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg2",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第2引数",
    "en": "Arg 2"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:matter",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "案件",
    "en": "Case"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:amount",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "金額",
    "en": "Amount"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:limit",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "限度額",
    "en": "Limit"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:budget",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "予算",
    "en": "Budget"
   },
   "_comment": "予算の識別子（予算コード）。調達・起案・承認・予算合計が、どの予算の話かをこれで持つ"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:budgetCode",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "予算コード",
    "en": "Budget code"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:users",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "#Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "利用者",
    "en": "Users"
   },
   "_comment": "その予算で起案できる人。利用者が1人の予算もある（追記R568）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:confirmedTotal",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "確定合計",
    "en": "Confirmed total"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:confirmedMatters",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "確定案件",
    "en": "Confirmed cases"
   },
   "_comment": "確定合計に含めた案件の ID（文字列）。調達のレコードを指さない——指すと、合計を読める人が調達の中身も読めてしまう（規則2b）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:refersTo",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "参照",
    "en": "Refers to"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Draft",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Cancelable",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:matter",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:amount",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:budget",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#completeOrSuspendByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "起案",
    "en": "Draft"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Approval",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Cancelable",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:approvedMatter",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:approvedAmount",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:approvedBudget",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認",
    "en": "Approve"
   },
   "_comment": "予算管理担当が承認する。承認の OK を、予算の上での確定とみなす（追記R562・R563）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Procurement",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:matter",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:amount",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:budget",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#agent",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#inChannel",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "調達",
    "en": "Procurement"
   },
   "_comment": "業務フローノードの型（ゴール述語）。案件ごとに起動され、起案者の分割チャネルに入る（基幹業務。追記R494・R546）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:BudgetTotal",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Cancelable",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:budget",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:limit",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:confirmedList",
     "minCardinality": 0
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:confirmedTotal",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:confirmedMatters",
     "minCardinality": 0
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#agent",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#inChannel",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "予算合計",
    "en": "Budget total"
   },
   "_comment": "予算管理担当が作る、予算の合計のレコード（ゴール述語。トーク的業務。取消可能タスク——巻き戻しでレコードも取り消す。追記R573）。案件の金額や中身は持たず、合計と案件の ID だけを持つ（追記R547・R562・R563）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:procurements",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:bud:Procurement",
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:bud:refersTo",
   "label": {
    "ja": "調達",
    "en": "Procurements"
   },
   "_comment": "誰も書かない refersTo の多値。予算合計の節が検索で値を作る（追記R554・R558・R560）。データには書かない"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:approvedMatter",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "domain": "urn:bud:Approval",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "案件",
    "en": "Case"
   },
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:bud:refersTo",
   "_comment": "承認から見た案件 は、起案者が調達に入れた値を承認者が読む値である——refersTo の下位属性として宣言する（受け渡しは、渡す側の欄を受け取る側が refersTo の属性で読む。追記R517）。refersTo の下位属性は編集権限を広げないので、承認者は案件を書けない（追記R626）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:approvedAmount",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "domain": "urn:bud:Approval",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "金額",
    "en": "Amount"
   },
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:bud:refersTo",
   "_comment": "承認から見た金額 は、起案者が調達に入れた値を承認者が読む値である——refersTo の下位属性として宣言する（受け渡しは、渡す側の欄を受け取る側が refersTo の属性で読む。追記R517）。refersTo の下位属性は編集権限を広げないので、承認者は金額を書けない（追記R626）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:approvedBudget",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "domain": "urn:bud:Approval",
   "range": "string",
   "label": {
    "ja": "予算",
    "en": "Budget"
   },
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:bud:refersTo",
   "_comment": "承認から見た予算 は、起案者が調達に入れた値を承認者が読む値である——refersTo の下位属性として宣言する（受け渡しは、渡す側の欄を受け取る側が refersTo の属性で読む。追記R517）。refersTo の下位属性は編集権限を広げないので、承認者は予算を書けない（追記R626）"
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:bud:Budget",
   "@type": "Class",
   "_comment": "マスターのレコード。担当者（agent）が予算管理担当で、予算合計を作り、承認する。利用者が1人の予算も複数人の予算も、担当者は同じ予算管理担当の人である（追記R802。違いは利用者の欄で表す）。調達の節が existing: _true で検索する",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:bud:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:budgetCode",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:limit",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:users",
     "minCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:bud:procurements",
     "minCardinality": 0
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#agent",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#completeByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#inChannel",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "予算",
    "en": "Budget"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "#ONTOc1",
   "@type": "Class",
   "_comment": "チャネル",
   "subClassOf": [
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#ontoC",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#onto0",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
